m.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2o4n.pdp_revamp.product_detail.i2.77934ac7dnbiKG\"\u003e- Dạng gel dễ tán, thấm nhanh trên da, không gây nặng mặt, không có cảm giác nhờn rít.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2o4n.pdp_revamp.product_detail.i2.77934ac7dnbiKG\"\u003e- Dưỡng ẩm tốt, vừa chống nắng, vừa dưỡng da, kết hợp 2in1 trong cùng 1 sản phẩm.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2o4n.pdp_revamp.product_detail.i2.77934ac7dnbiKG\"\u003e- Chống nắng phổ rộng, bảo vệ da khỏi tia UVA và UVB với chỉ số chống nắng SPF50+ PA++++\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2o4n.pdp_revamp.product_detail.i2.77934ac7dnbiKG\"\u003e- Có thể rửa sạch dễ dàng với xà phòng tắm bình thường.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2o4n.pdp_revamp.product_detail.i4.77934ac7dnbiKG\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eTHÀNH PHẦN\u003c/strong\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"bd_2\" class=\"com-struct\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"bd_2_container_0\" class=\"com-struct\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv id=\"shell-com-1323623556\" class=\"J_module\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"module-detailImageText\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cdiv\u003e\n\u003cp data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2o4n.pdp_revamp.product_detail.i5.77934ac7dnbiKG\"\u003eWater, Ethylhexyl Methoxycinnamate, Alcohol, Titanium Dioxide, Diethylamino Hydroxybenzoyl Hexyl Benzoate, Octocrylene, Butylene Glycol, Dimethicone, Steareth-6, Carbomer, Acrylates/C10-30 Alkyl Acrylate Crosspolymer, Aluminum Hydroxide, Hydrated Silica, Silica, Mica, Rosmarinus Officinalis (Rosemary) Leaf Extract, Prunus Persica (Peach) Leaf Extract, Aloe Barbadensis Leaf Extract, Coix Lacryma-Jobi Ma-yuen Seed Extract, Citrus Junos Peel Oil, Cocos Nucifera (Coconut) Oil, Xanthan Gum, Tetrasodium EDTA, Sodium Hydroxide, BHT, Phenoxyethanol, Methylparaben, Blue 1 (CI 42090), Red 33 (CI 17200).\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp data-spm-anchor-id=\"a2o4n.pdp_revamp.product_detail.i5.77934ac7dnbiKG\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eHƯỚNG DẪN SỬ DỤNG\u003c/strong\u